|YK0================================================================
                              |GKBRemote Tithe
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'Gold pieces?  A Monk needs not these things.'|WKO - |RKBPliny the Elder|YK0

As a Monk, we all know we feel that it is unnecessary to be
distracted by too much money.  It is far more appropriate to
simply tithe this money to the Abbey. However, in our travels,
it is difficult to make it all the way back to get rid of
a troublesome amount. Remote Tithe allows a Monk to tithe
just how it sounds; without having to be sitting at
Maelstrom's feet.

|BK0This is a Master of the East Wind power.

|YKO================================================================
